==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Knuckles (Enemy)|Knuckles]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although this stage has a Metal Hippoe, you can still use [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] with attack [[Cat Combo]]s, like [[Cool Japan (Combo)|Cool Japan]], to easily clear this stage.

